db/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-15811](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-15811)\r\n### Description\n\nPgVectorIndexTest.Drop/Colocated [is failing](https://jenkins.dev.yugabyte.com/job/yugabyte-db-phabricator/341007/artifact/build/release-clang17-full-lto-ninja/yb-test-logs/tests-pgwrapper__pg_vector_index-test/PgVectorIndexTest_Drop__Colocated.log) with the following stack:\n```\n[ts-3] I0319 15:41:21.255297 12249 vector_lsm.cc:1007] T fc12f723dc93420e941da1cb9bf47bfa P {ts3_peer_id} VI 00004000000030008000000000004102: Flush: wait: 0\nlibc++abi: terminating due to uncaught exception of type std::runtime_error: No such file or directory\n*** Aborted at 1742398881 (unix time) try \"date -d @1742398881\" if you are using GNU date ***\nPC: @                0x0 (unknown)\n*** SIGABRT (@0x7100002e56) received by PID 11862 (TID 0xffbf5e867400) from PID 11862; stack trace: ***\n    @     0xffff78586274 __GI_raise\n    @     0xffff78570a2c __GI_abort\n    @     0xffff8005a424 abort_message\n    @     0xffff8003b8c0 demangling_terminate_handler()\n    @     0xffff800593ac std::__terminate()\n    @     0xffff8005c660 __cxxabiv1::failed_throw()\n    @     0xffff8005c5cc __cxa_throw\n    @     0xffff7bd03604 yb::vector_index::IndexWrapperBase<>::SaveToFile()\n    @     0xffff7bd217ec yb::vector_index::VectorLSM<>::DoSaveChunk()\n    @     0xffff7bd211f4 yb::vector_index::VectorLSM<>::SaveChunk()\n    @     0xffff7a6d0c30 yb::rpc::(anonymous namespace)::Worker::Execute()\n    @     0xffff79dc7970 yb::Thread::SuperviseThread()\n    @     0xffff786d78b8 start_thread\n    @     0xffff78573afc thread_start\n```\nThe thrown exception says \"std::runtime_error: No such file or directory\", which most likely means a vector index directory does not exist by the time of saving the chunk to disk. Such scenario seems to be possible because `VectorLSM<Vector, DistanceResult>::Insert()` does not take `stopping_` flag into account and in theory can be happening after vector index shutdown has been triggered. And it is actually triggered by `VectorLSM<Vector, DistanceResult>::Drop()` in the mentioned unit test.\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-15811]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-15811?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/26449/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/26449/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":17858360218,"node_id":"AE_lADOBlCVUc6vH4RGzwAAAAQocPOa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/17858360218","actor":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"assigned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null